<div style="margin:0; padding:24px 12px; background:#f6f7fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#111827;">
  <div style="max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; line-height:1.6; font-size:15px;">
    <p style="margin-top:0;">Dear Customer,</p>
    <% if @only_vip %>
      <%= render "offers_mailer/vip_full", invitation: @invitation %>
    <% else %>
      <p>Your invitation for a Russian visa has been sent to you in a separate email. As you prepare for your upcoming travels, we would like to share some important information and services that will make your trip to Russia smooth and comfortable.</p>
      <% @keys.each do |key| %>
        <%= render "offers_mailer/#{key}", invitation: @invitation, rate: @rate %>
      <% end %>
      <p>If you have any questions or would like to arrange any of these services, simply reply to this email or submit a request on our website. We are happy to help make your trip to Russia smooth and comfortable.</p>
    <% end %>
    <p>Best regards,<br>Russvisa Team</p>
  </div>
</div>
